---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Mehdi from '@src/assets/img/mehdi.jpg';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';

---

<BaseLayout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
>
  <div class='container'>
		<main class='prose text-lg dark:prose-invert'>
      <article>
        <div class='w-full md:flex md:items-center gap-16 mb-10'>
          <div class="text-pretty leading-9">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Hi There 👋, Mehdi Here! </h1>
            <Prose>
              <div class="text-lg">
                <p>I'm a web developer in my third year of Computer Science at the University of Le Havre Normandy, passionate about project management and creating dashboards with Power BI. My skills include programming (PHP, Java, C), database management (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle) and web development with Laravel, WordPress, and Symfony.</p>
                <p>Eager to share my projects and knowledge, I'm also active on <a href="https://github.com/MehdiLazaar" target="_blank">my GitHub</a>. Explore my recent projects and posts below!</p>
              </div>
            </Prose>
          </div>
          <Image src={Mehdi} alt="Muhammad Syakirurohman" width={300}  class="rounded-3xl rotate-3 mx-4 md:mx-0"/>
        </div>     
        <div>
          <p>
            Passionate about web development and driven by a genuine interest in learning, 
            I am a dedicated developer completing my third year in a Computer Science degree, 
            with a strong foundation in programming, project management, and database design. 
            Throughout my studies, I have developed diverse technical skills—from Power BI and macro scripting to full-stack web development using PHP, Laravel, and MySQL. 
            I am eager to further explore and deepen my knowledge in both familiar and emerging technologies.
          </p>
          During my recent internship, 
          I had the opportunity to create a web application for managing tutor-student interactions using FileMaker Pro. 
          This project allowed me to lead all phases of development—from needs analysis and database configuration to interface design and script writing. 
          I enhanced the user experience by building an intuitive interface, ensuring ease of use for all users. By managing complex requirements, 
          adapting to new tools, and assisting fellow interns in their projects, I developed both my technical and teamwork skills.
          <p>
            With a proactive mindset and a commitment to continuous improvement, 
            I am ready to bring my skills and motivation to contribute meaningfully to future projects. 
            I am excited about new challenges that push my boundaries, expose me to innovative practices, and allow me to grow alongside a dynamic team.
          </p>

